WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
How about you win in a competition?

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:04,040
I can arrange a short-term but high-paying job for you

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:05,960
Work that is not tiring makes me crazy

4
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,380
Compared to what

5
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,740
Who can come out of it first?

6
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:10,180
Won't be scared enough to scream

7
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,380
There is surveillance here

8
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,060
I will work hard

9
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:15,420
This time it's different from the haunted house where I fucked in high school.

10
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:17,300
You can't pretend to be cool with your hands in your pockets anymore

11
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,580
I'm not trying to be cool

12
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,260
Don’t you think the air conditioner in that haunted house is too cold?

13
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:22,670
Do you want to do it after so many years?

14
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:25,590
I thought the Rou family was just pretending to be cool.

15
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:27,390
What the hell is air conditioning?

16
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:29,420
Local players please line up and assemble

17
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:31,520
The interior of the haunted house is being restored to its original location

18
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,760
If you need a fifteen-minute break, please come here.

19
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:36,040
Confirmation in person and signature

20
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,580
It's our turn

21
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:38,780
Just wait

22
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:41,180
This time I will definitely win the first point

23
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:42,140
top priority

24
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,380
No because we allow it

25
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,500
The plot requires fighting NPCs

26
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,420
Just hit the second point to death

27
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:49,020
Super NPCs are not allowed to hit the third one on the head.
